<div class="art-title">商务部新闻发言人就美商务部发布限制远程获取先进半导体相关措施答记者问<span class="zc-word"></span></div>
<div ergodic="article" class="art-con art-con-bottonmLine"><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: normal; text-indent: 40.15pt; line-height: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">问：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;">11<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">16</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日，美国商务部发布限制远程获取先进半导体相关措施。请问中方对此有何评论？</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: normal; text-indent: 40.15pt; line-height: 32pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">答：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">中方注意到有关情况。美方泛化国家安全概念，滥用出口管制，对中国</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">企业</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">与</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">其他国家企业</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">正常贸易合作横加干涉</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">。美方做法背离</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">两国元首达成的重要共识，破坏市场规则和国际经贸秩序，冲击全球半导体产业链供应链稳定。中方对此强烈不满，坚决反对。</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: normal; text-indent: 40pt; line-height: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">中方希望美方能够</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">与中方</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">相向而行，回到协商合作解决分歧的正确轨道上来。若美方</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">一意孤行</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，中方将采取反制措施，坚定维护国家主权、安全、发展利益。</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 20pt;"></span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: normal; text-indent: 40pt; line-height: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 20pt;">&#xa0;</span></p><p style="margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: normal; text-indent: 21.3pt; line-height: 16pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 10.5pt;">&#xa0;</span></p><p><br /></p></div>
